, math art, math animation, physics, satisfying, shorts"},"about":{"title":"Ulam’s Prime Diagonals","sources":[{"label":"Spiralling primes","url":"https://thatsmaths.com/2019/09/12/spiraling-primes/"}],"math":"Write 1, 2, 3 … on a square spiral and light up the primes.","aha":"Stanisław Ulam noticed in 1963 that the primes crowd onto diagonal lines: each diagonal is a quadratic like 4n² + bn + c."}}]}
